{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>英皇國際以超過1.6億元出售一幅西貢住宅地皮，預計收益約1,020萬元。</p><p></p><p>地皮面積約6.5萬平方呎，截至今年9月底止的估值為1.61億元，與出售價格相同。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T00:59:12.014605+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T00:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T01:17:47.247756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T00:57:37.339449+00:00","content_hash":"c875d38b97733208577ea4aa0406022e45f912885b780220e670c793d3c50634","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}